'''Circuit''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade and handle are both solid black with bright green circuit lines imprinted on them, hence the name. The guard is also bright green.

== Trivia ==
*It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/2495296/profile/ nettimato].
*The original name of this knife was "Short Circuit".
*This knife, along with many other knives, are from other Murder games. ''For example: Twisted Murderer.''
*The description of this knife is: "This knife might be bad for their circulation".<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/161956246/SKIN-Short-Circuit Model created by nettimato]</ref>

